{"id":"u-c9c88fa2-5439-46a2-8549-89f081104fc5","src":"community","title":"12-Week Neck-Friendly Training Plan","author":"Giannis F.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/kTrWoe-4-day-split-neckupper-back-friendly","desc":"Phase 1 – Weeks 1–4 (Rep Foundation)\n🎯 Focus: Build movement quality, 8–10 reps main lifts, 10–15 accessories, ~65–70% 1RM.\n\nPhase 2 – Weeks 5–8 (Volume Push, Hypertrophy)\n🎯 Focus: Slightly heavier loads, 6–8 reps main lifts, 8–12 accessories, ~70–75% 1RM.\n\nPhase 3 – Weeks 9–12 (Intensity Push, Strength)\n🎯 Focus: Heavy but safe loads, 4–6 reps main lifts, 6–10 accessories, ~75–85% 1RM.\n\nProgression Week by Week:\nWeeks 1–4: Add 1–2 reps each week within range.\nWeeks 5–6, 8: Add weight (2.5–5%) when you hit the top of rep range.\nWeek 7: Deload (lighter, fewer sets).\nWeeks 9–12: Lower reps, increase load. Track best 5k pace in Week 12.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T15:49:04.085Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push","Pull","Legs","Run / Conditioning","Hybrid/Weak Points"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"pct":70,"x":4}]},{"n":"Landmine Press","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"pct":70,"x":2}]},{"n":"Push Up","sets":[{"amrap":1,"pct":70,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"pct":70,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Neutral Grip)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Arm Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":